{
 "_note": "The machine is written as a system preset: Bambu Studio's command line then names the printer by it when it checks the process. The profiles Agent Link writes for OrcaSlicer and Bambu Studio when no presets are chosen: only what the print setup says, the slicer's defaults for the rest. {name} is the setup's value. Edit or replace this file to change them; slicer_presets chooses the person's own instead. Each per-filament list a filament gives is one long (OrcaSlicer 2.5 checks them against the number of filaments).",
